msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Outliner Library Override Troubleshoot Operation"
msgstr "Outliner ﺭﺩ ﻪﻧﺎﺨﺑﺎﺘﮐ ﯽﺴﯾﻮﻧﺯﺎﺑ ﯽﺑﺎﯾ‌ﺐﯿﻋ ﺕﺎﯿﻠﻤﻋ"


msgid "Advanced operations over library override to help fix broken hierarchies"
